{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>In that land.</b> Even though it is not reckoned like the land of Israel itself — the land of the seven nations (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>In that year.</b> Even though it was not as it should be — for it was a year of famine (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>In that land, in that year.</b> Why both? To say that the land was hard and the year was hard." "<b>A hundredfold.</b> For they estimated how much it was fit to yield, and it yielded a hundred times what they had estimated. And our Rabbis said: this estimate was for tithes."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:37.334246071Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}